    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/e49d78-3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=612020776475820643&sectionId=612049063180763667)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"gg092gOx8GW_text","label":"gg092gOx8GW_text","default":"<p>A Note from the Founder</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_9dlGZcXO_text","label":"gg_9dlGZcXO_text","default":"Why I Built<br><span style=\"color:#008346;\">Wellness Nest</span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDH8sTo-9U_text","label":"ggDH8sTo-9U_text","default":"<p><i>\"I didn't start this company to sell supplements. I started it because I lost the two people who mattered most.\"</i></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcqDjZNBV-_text","label":"ggcqDjZNBV-_text","default":"<p>Eleven years ago, my mother died from a stroke. Three years later, my father suffered one too. He's been in a vegetative state ever since.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Those moments rewired how I think about health. I stopped trusting labels and started demanding proof. I traveled to 12+ countries, visiting manufacturing facilities, studying regulations, testing every product I could find.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What I discovered was an industry built on marketing, not science. Proprietary blends that hide what's inside. Claims with no verification. Products designed to sell — not to work.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Wellness Nest is my answer. Every formula I sell, I take myself. Every batch we produce, we publish the lab report. Not because regulators require it — but because you deserve the same standard I demand for my own family.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJU8aZ9ev6_text","label":"ggJU8aZ9ev6_text","default":"<p>\"My mission is to live the longest, healthiest life possible - and to prove every single thing I put in my body along the way. If a formula can't survive a lab report, it doesn't deserve to survive on your shelf.\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjraiioll__text","label":"ggjraiioll__text","default":"<p>- Wellness Nest, Founder</p>"}],
    "blocks": [{"type": "@app"}],
